exports[`fscale facts > prints human output 1`] = `
"Package managers: pnpm
Lockfiles: none
Languages: javascript
Tools: pnpm-workspace
Commands at the repo root:
  build: pnpm run build
  test: pnpm run test
Projects (3):
  @x/a [node] packages/a
    stack: javascript, pnpm
  @x/b [node] packages/b
    stack: javascript, pnpm
    depends on: @x/a
  root [node] .
    stack: javascript, pnpm
    build: pnpm run build
    test: pnpm run test
    install: pnpm install
Graph (1 edges; fscale graph --explain says where each comes from):
  packages/b -> packages/a (dependency by name, package.json)
"
`;

